It prints only the changed tag and the remaining `title` attribute for each element:

```text
movie {'title': 'The Little Prince'}
movie {'title': 'Hamlet'}
```

It prints the changed tag with both the existing `title` and new `rate` attributes:

```text
movie {'title': 'The Little Prince', 'rate': '5'}
movie {'title': 'Hamlet', 'rate': '5'}
```
